c9feb3b9fe86d87.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "arabic": "ٱرْحَمْ", "plain": "اِرْحَمْ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/b499513a9663f8f6ae51.m4a", "recited": "audio/93227c1806515549b320.m4a", "recitedText": "وَٱرْحَمْ"}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anti", "arabic": "اِرْحَمِي", "plain": "اِرْحَمِي", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/e134ff143ded49ca0554.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اِرْحَمَا", "plain": "اِرْحَمَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/9d1ef78ed96846ed7d04.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "اِرْحَمُوا", "plain": "اِرْحَمُوا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/5960d21f2511460ceb3c.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اِرْحَمْنَ", "plain": "اِرْحَمْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/231d5cff4e94331e9a62.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "44:42", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4456.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Save him on whom Allah hath mercy. Lo! He is the Mighty, the Merciful.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ancak Allah'ın merhamet ettiği kimseler böyle değildir. Şüphesiz ki Allah çok güçlüdür, çok merhamet edicidir.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "مگر جس پر اللہ رحم کرے بیشک وہی عزت والا مہربان ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "kecuali orang yang diberi rahmat oleh Allah. Sesungguhnya Dialah Yang Maha Perkasa lagi Maha Penyayang.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "إِلَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَّحِمَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/f40df72cdc6796f4cf5b.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "smilovao se", "en": "He has had mercy", "tr": "merhamet etti", "fr": "a fait miséricorde", "id": "Dia telah mengasihi", "ur": "اس نے رحم کیا", "bn": "তিনি দয়া করেছেন", "fa": "رحم کرده است"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِنَّهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَزِيزُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "23:118", "tense": "imperative", "category": {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2791.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And (O Muhammad) say: My Lord! Forgive and have mercy, for Thou art Best of all who show mercy.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Resulüm! De ki: \"Rabbim, bağışla ve merhamet et! Sen merhametlilerin en iyisisin.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تم عرض کرو، اے میرے رب بخش دے اور رحم فرما اور تو سب سے برتر رحم کرنے والا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan katakanlah: \"Ya Tuhanku berilah ampun dan berilah rahmat, dan Engkau adalah Pemberi rahmat Yang Paling baik\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَقُل", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَّبِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱغْفِرْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَٱرْحَمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/93227c1806515549b320.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i smiluj se", "en": "and have mercy", "tr": "ve merhamet et", "fr": "et fais miséricorde", "id": "dan kasihanilah", "ur": "اور رحم کر", "bn": "এবং দয়া করো", "fa": "و رحم کن"}}, {"text": "وَأَنتَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خَيْرُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلرَّٰحِمِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "29:21", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3361.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He punisheth whom He will and showeth mercy unto whom He will, and unto Him ye will be turned.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O, dilediğine azab eder, dilediğine rahmet eder. Ancak O'na döndürüleceksiniz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "عذاب دیتا ہے جسے چاہے اور رحم فرماتا ہے جس پر چاہے اور تمہیں اسی کی طرف پھرنا ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Allah mengazab siapa yang dikehendaki-Nya, dan memberi rahmat kepada siapa yang dikehendaki-Nya, dan hanya kepada-Nya-lah kamu akan dikembalikan.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يُعَذِّبُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيَرْحَمُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/42135e2252049fe6a6b4.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "i smiluje se", "en": "and He has mercy", "tr": "ve merhamet eder", "fr": "et Il fait miséricorde", "id": "dan Dia mengasihi", "ur": "اور وہ رحم کرتا ہے", "bn": "এবং তিনি দয়া করেন", "fa": "و رحم می‌کند"}}, {"text": "مَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِلَيْهِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُقْلَبُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "7:23", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/977.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "They said: Our Lord! We have wronged ourselves. If thou forgive us not and have not mercy on us, surely we are of the lost!", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Dediler ki: \"Ey Rabbimiz! Biz kendimize zulmettik, eğer bizi bağışlamaz ve bize rahmetinle muamele etmezsen muhakkak ziyana uğrayacaklardan oluruz!\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "دونوں نے عرض کی، اے رب ہمارے! ہم نے اپنا آپ بُرا کیا، تو اگر تُو ہمیں نہ بخشے اور ہم پر رحم نہ کرے تو ہم ضرور نقصان والوں میں ہوئے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Keduanya berkata: \"Ya Tuhan kami, kami telah menganiaya diri kami sendiri, dan jika Engkau tidak mengampuni kami dan memberi rahmat kepada kami, niscaya pastilah kami termasuk orang-orang yang merugi.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبَّنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ظَلَمْنَآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَنفُسَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَإِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَّمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَغْفِرْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَتَرْحَمْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/aafdf67868c9d419d8d0.m4a", "gloss": null, "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": ["nahnu"], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"text": "لَنَكُونَنَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْخَٰسِرِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "23:75", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2748.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Though We had mercy on them and relieved them of the harm afflicting them, they still would wander blindly on in their contumacy.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Eğer onlara acıyıp da için de bulundukları sıkıntıyı giderseydik, iyice körleşerek azgınlıklarında büsbütün direnirlerdi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور اگر ہم ان پر رحم کریں اور جو مصیبت ان پر پڑی ہے ٹال دیں تو ضرور بھٹ پنا (احسان فراموشی) کریں گے اپنی سرکشی میں بہکتے ہوئے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Andaikata mereka Kami belas kasihani, dan Kami lenyapkan kemudharatan yang mereka alami, benar-benar mereka akan terus menerus terombang-ambing dalam keterlaluan mereka.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَحِمْنَٰهُمْ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8e54c8364a5b5f67a4de.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we had mercy on them", "bs": "smilovali smo im se", "tr": "onlara merhamet ettik", "fr": "nous leur avons fait miséricorde", "id": "kami telah merahmati mereka", "ur": "ہم نے ان پر رحم کیا", "bn": "আমরা তাদের প্রতি দয়া করেছি", "fa": "به آنان رحم کردیم"}}, {"text": "وَكَشَفْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِهِم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِّن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ضُرٍّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَّلَجُّوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "طُغْيَٰنِهِمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَعْمَهُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "40:9", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4142.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And ward off from them ill-deeds; and he from whom Thou wardest off ill-deeds that day, him verily hast Thou taken into mercy. That is the supreme triumph.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "\"Onları fenalıklardan koru. Sen her kimi fenalıklardan korursan, o gün muhakkak onu rahmetinle yarlığamışsındır. İşte asıl büyük kurtuluş da budur.\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور انہیں گناہوں کی شامت سے بچالے، اور جسے تو اس دن گناہوں کی شامت سے بچائے تو بیشک تو نے اس پر رحم فرمایا، اور یہی بڑی کامیابی ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "dan peliharalah mereka dari (balasan) kejahatan. Dan orang-orang yang Engkau pelihara dari (pembalasan) kejahatan pada hari itu maka sesungguhnya telah Engkau anugerahkan rahmat kepadanya dan itulah kemenangan yang besar\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَقِهِمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَقِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَوْمَئِذٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَحِمْتَهُۥ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/68b9724f493925619a2a.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you had mercy on him", "bs": "smilovao si mu se", "tr": "ona merhamet ettin", "fr": "tu lui as fait miséricorde", "id": "kamu telah merahmatinya", "ur": "تم نے اس پر رحم کیا", "bn": "তুমি তার প্রতি দয়া করেছিলে", "fa": "به او رحم کردی"}}, {"text": "وَذَٰلِكَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هُوَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْفَوْزُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَظِيمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "تُرْحَمُونَ", "count": 8, "first": "3:132", "audio": "audio/e7ba4eb2a441cb8d469e.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": true, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "you (all) are shown mercy", "bs": "bivate pomilovani", "tr": "merhamet görürsünüz", "fr": "vous êtes objets de miséricorde", "id": "kalian dirahmati", "ur": "تم پر رحم کیا جاتا ہے", "bn": "তোমাদের রহমত করা হয়", "fa": "مورد رحمت قرار می‌گیرید"}}, {"arabic": "رَّحِمَ", "count": 3, "first": "11:43", "audio": "audio/f40df72cdc6796f4cf5b.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "smilovao se", "en": "He has had mercy", "tr": "merhamet etti", "fr": "a fait miséricorde", "id": "Dia telah mengasihi", "ur": "اس نے رحم کیا", "bn": "তিনি দয়া করেছেন", "fa": "رحم کرده است"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱرْحَمْنَا", "count": 2, "first": "7:155", "audio": "audio/4e10e2f76f5d29f5d86d.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["nahnu"]}], "gloss": {"en": "and have mercy on us!", "bs": "i smiluj nam se!", "tr": "ve bize merhamet et!", "fr": "et fais-nous miséricorde !", "id": "dan rahmatilah kami!", "ur": "اور ہم پر رحم کر!", "bn": "এবং আমাদের প্রতি দয়া কর!", "fa": "و به ما رحم کن!"}}, {"arabic": "وَٱرْحَمْنَآ", "count": 1, "first": "2:286", "audio": "audio/361a9bf9dd63064251db.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["nahnu"]}], "gloss": {"en": "and have mercy on us!", "bs": "i smiluj nam se!", "tr": "ve bize merhamet et!", "fr": "et fais-nous miséricorde !", "id": "dan rahmatilah kami!", "ur": "اور ہم پر رحم کر!", "bn": "এবং আমাদের প্রতি দয়া কর!", "fa": "و به ما رحم کن!"}}, {"arabic": "رَحِمَهُۥ", "count": 1, "first": "6:16", "audio": "audio/6ddde1ada6df45ef1253.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"]}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it had mercy on him", "bs": "smilovao mu se", "tr": "ona merhamet etti", "fr": "il lui fit miséricorde", "id": "dia telah merahmatinya", "ur": "اُس نے اس پر رحم کیا", "bn": "সে তার প্রতি দয়া করেছে", "fa": "به او رحم کرد"}}, {"arabic": "وَتَرْحَمْنَا", "count": 1, "first": "7:23", "audio": "audio/aafdf67868c9d419d8d0.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hiya", "passive": false, "objects": ["nahnu"], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"arabic": "يَرْحَمْنَا", "count": 1, "first": "7:149", "audio": "audio/1caf457086fd50d8aefb.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["nahnu"], "mood": "jussive"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it has mercy on us", "bs": "smiluje nam se", "tr": "bize merhamet eder", "fr": "il nous fait miséricorde", "id": "dia merahmati kami", "ur": "وہ ہم پر رحم کرتا ہے", "bn": "সে আমাদের প্রতি দয়া করে", "fa": "به ما رحم کند"}}, {"arabic": "سَيَرْحَمُهُمُ", "count": 1, "first": "9:71", "audio": "audio/d5e68f15ad017c8303f7.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["hum"], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it will have mercy on them", "bs": "smilovat će im se", "tr": "onlara merhamet edecek", "fr": "il leur fera miséricorde", "id": "dia akan merahmati mereka", "ur": "وہ ان پر رحم کرے گا", "bn": "সে তাদের প্রতি দয়া করবে", "fa": "به آنان رحم خواهد کرد"}}, {"arabic": "وَتَرْحَمْنِىٓ", "count": 1, "first": "11:47", "audio": "audio/2e0d2c24bcda9f17e634.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "anta", "passive": false, "objects": ["ana"], "mood": "jussive"}]}, {"arabic": "رَحِمَ", "count": 1, "first": "12:53", "audio": "audio/89ead17b7db1d025b605.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it had mercy", "bs": "smilovao se", "tr": "mer